w to play together. In this game, a high score means a big loss. Learn more about the meaning of the ace score in between the mini-games. ", "short_description": "Make peace with your raging inner child. Play with your new frenemy in seven rounds of childish games while an ill-tempered ice cream monster melts all over your charmingly gross playpen. Keep your frenemy's ace score low in this weird, artsy brawler. Play nice, and maybe you will make a new friend. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.krakxr.co/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RAARAlab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.krakxr.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "23928352013478270"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2794352434036119"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2794352434036119"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1722006349, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2794352434036119"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25017663627880431", "version": "1.84"}, "id": "921375312209980", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary"